_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-29T18:26:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T00:06:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120743","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120743.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120743.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Will contribute to the close https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80064\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nIn the original function, when several instances of light claimed the best quadrant, the first instance of light that came into this quadrant fell. It was also impossible to change the visible light sources (those that were rendered in the frame). Now, with a large difference in coverage of 1.5, the shadow can be replaced by a more suitable instance, even if it is visible, but the prioritization will try to replace the invisible one. The coefficient of 1.5 is conditional, it's probably worth reviewing, or even better, adjusting in the project settings. The engine was compiled with these changes, and occasionally there was a slight flicker (and errors, but without crashes, pre-sorting by coverage is needed) when changing visible shadows (In version 4.6.3).\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit: See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120583.*\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120743/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120743/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}